  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Commitment Discount ID > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L007: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST be of type String.\"",
    "  L010: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST conform to [StringHandling](#attributes.stringhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L011: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST adhere to the following nullability requirements:\"",
    "    L012: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST be null when a [*charge*](#glossary:charge) is not related to a *commitment discount*.\"",
    "    L013: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST NOT be null when a *charge* is related to a *commitment discount*.\"",
    "  L014: \"When CommitmentDiscountId is not null, CommitmentDiscountId MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "    L015: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST be a unique identifier within the service provider.\"",
    "    L016: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST be equal to [ResourceId](#datasets.costandusage.resourceid) when [ChargeCategory](#datasets.costandusage.chargecategory) is \\\"Purchase\\\" and the *charge* represents a purchase of that *commitment discount*.\"",
    "    L017: \"CommitmentDiscountId MUST be equal to ResourceId when ChargeCategory is \\\"Usage\\\" and the *charge* represents an unused portion of that *commitment discount*.\"",
    "    L018: \"CommitmentDiscountId SHOULD be a fully-qualified identifier.\""
  ],
